WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:03,740
It's said outside that you are an ignorant and unskilled loser.

2
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:07,740
I think it's a bit biased. That's right.

3
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:09,240
Am I a loser?

4
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:11,140
I was forcing my father to make progress

5
00:00:13,270 --> 00:00:15,070
I just said it was a bit biased

6
00:00:15,370 --> 00:00:17,070
It’s not that the rumors are untrue.

7
00:00:17,270 --> 00:00:18,870
As for climbing along the pole?

8
00:00:19,880 --> 00:00:20,980
Put it this way

9
00:00:21,180 --> 00:00:23,280
You offended Marquis Yongping with your front foot

10
00:00:23,580 --> 00:00:25,980
The back foot offended the former Duke's Mansion again

11
00:00:26,380 --> 00:00:28,280
It’s also to force your father to make progress.

12
00:00:29,070 --> 00:00:32,470
Over there, Marquis Yongping, don't be shameless and I'll stand in front of you.

13
00:00:33,490 --> 00:00:35,090
As for the former prince of the country,

14
00:00:35,290 --> 00:00:36,290
I didn't do anything

15
00:00:36,890 --> 00:00:40,700
How can I be considered offended?

16
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:42,400
Makes sense

17
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:45,000
Marquis Yongping has been punished for half a year

18
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:47,200
Do you want to know your punishment?

19
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:49,200
Even if it wasn’t for me, I would also be punished

20
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:51,000
Your Majesty does have this intention

21
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:53,500
If you can satisfy me today

22
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:56,700
I can help you sort this out

23
00:00:56,900 --> 00:00:59,840
Don’t even think about whether a man likes a woman or not

24
00:01:00,040 --> 00:01:01,440
nothing else
